      },
      "message": "test(wire): pin the lower guide refusal by its own words\n\nThe review of PR #2928 found no test for the message of the\n\"below the lower guide\" refusal. A vertical punch on a machine whose\nlower guide is at Z1 now must be refused with that exact text, and no\nNC file is written.\n\nRefs #2923\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
